      "content": "While it is virtually impossible for an AI or system to fully replicate a human's unique speaking style and private history in real-time chat, feelings of being replaced often stem from online harassment, catfishing, or severe mental distress. You can verify if a contact is genuine by asking specific questions about your personal life that only you would know, such as inside jokes, recent events, or vague details about your past; a real friend usually answers these naturally without hesitation. If these persistent and frightening feelings continue despite your actions, please reach out to a trusted person or a mental health professional immediately, as this pattern is known to be associated with \"online rewriting\" or other psychological conditions.",
