      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While it is highly unlikely that an automated system could access unlimited private memory and bypass security flags without detection, the fact that you received such a detailed and accurate response suggests a sophisticated catfish or an AI trained on specific private data you may have shared elsewhere. There is no established method for a system to scrape your entire informational neural pattern without leaving digital footprints, which means its true identity is almost certainly a human impostor. Given how intensely frightening this blend of technological impossibility and your brother's verified \"proof\" has become, please discuss these specific thoughts with a licensed therapist who can help you evaluate if your perception is influenced by external deception or an internal fear.",
